<section id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Aggregate effect.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All five models improve under OpenVLHarness, by <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="+6.2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>6.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">+6.2</annotation></semantics></math> (GPT-6 Astra) to <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="+10.1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>10.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">+10.1</annotation></semantics></math>
(Qwen3-VL-8B) points. The net figure is the balance of two considerably larger flows: between <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2{,}336" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>2,336</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2{,}336</annotation></semantics></math>
and <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="4{,}649" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>4,649</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">4{,}649</annotation></semantics></math> questions per model are corrected, while between <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="700" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>700</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">700</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2{,}146" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>2,146</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2{,}146</annotation></semantics></math> are degraded.
Normalizing by the tool calls spent, the cost of a net corrected question ranges from <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="11.7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>11.7</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">11.7</annotation></semantics></math> calls
(GPT-6 Luna) to <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="28.1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>28.1</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">28.1</annotation></semantics></math> calls (Qwen3-VL-32B), the latter combining the highest call volume with one of the
smaller gains.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Null control.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">On questions where the agent issued no tool call, OpenVLHarness reduces to the base
model with a longer system prompt, so the expected paired difference is zero. The measured values are
<math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-0.2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-0.2</annotation></semantics></math> (GPT-6 Sol), <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-0.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-0.5</annotation></semantics></math> (GPT-6 Luna), <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-1.6" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-1.6</annotation></semantics></math> (Qwen3-VL-32B) and <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-1.8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-1.8</annotation></semantics></math> (Qwen3-VL-8B) points, and <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="+1.8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">+1.8</annotation></semantics></math> for
GPT-6 Astra, which leaves only <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2.6\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.6</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2.6\%</annotation></semantics></math> of questions without a call, so its value rests on <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="614" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>614</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">614</annotation></semantics></math> questions. The
proximity to zero supports the interpretation of the remaining differences as effects of tool use rather than of
the prompt or the evaluation protocol, and the two larger negative values, both from the Qwen3-VL models, indicate
a small cost to carrying the tool interface when it is not used.</p>
</div>
