<section id="A3.SS4.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Environment Update example.</h4>

<div id="A3.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">After every tool turn, the harness appends an Environment Update message that re-advertises the live memory namespace. The example below is taken verbatim from an FSCD-147 trajectory after two Visual Grounding calls; when web pages have been retrieved, the message additionally lists the registered <span id="A3.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">webpage_url_N</span> references.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="256.03" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 256.03" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,256.03) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 250.12 C 0 253.38 2.64 256.03 5.91 256.03 L 544.09 256.03 C 547.36 256.03 550 253.38 550 250.12 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 230.38 L 548.03 230.38 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 239.74)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
