<span id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px14.p2.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px14.p2.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Question] {question}</span></span>
