<div id="A5.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Together, these examples illustrate two ways to adapt the same general-purpose harness to custom data: refine the instructions and rendered evidence when existing capabilities suffice, or add reusable operations when failures call for explicit interpretation, output refinement, or tool composition.</p>
