<span id="A6.p650.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p650.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Why it is hard.<span id="A6.p650.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The product is not named anywhere, and the logos on the backpacks are too small to read.</span></span></span>
<span id="A6.p650.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p650.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">How the agent solves it.<span id="A6.p650.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> It grounds the two backpacks, tries to read each with zoom and OCR, and, when that fails, reverse-searches the crop of the green backpack, which identifies it as a Deuter Speed Lite Pro. A product page mentions no award, so it searches for awards and verifies the result on the manufacturer’s press release: the ISPO Award 2024. Nine calls use six different tools.</span></span></span>
