<br class="ltx_break">
# Pixel (1060, 47) in third image (depth_result_2)
<br class="ltx_break">
# Note: image dimensions are [height, width] = [966, 1302] per depth_result
<br class="ltx_break">
<span id="A6.p1338.pic1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span>
<br class="ltx_break">
