<span id="A6.p1404.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A6.p1404.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Coding agent generated and executed the following Python code:
